rite  <::before> Select  [ resumes  Share  Actions  ](/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/resumes) |  257 KB  |  2 minutes ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ Personnell_File  .odt  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Personnell_File.odt) |  27 KB  |  a year ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ salary  .txt  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary.txt) |  < 1 KB  |  a year ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ Salary_Analysis_Report  .odt  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Salary_Analysis_Report.odt) |  8 KB  |  a year ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ salary_increase  .txt  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase.txt) |  < 1 KB  |  a year ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ Software Engineer  .pdf  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Software%20Engineer.pdf) |  84 KB  |  a year ago   \\nFavorite  <::before> Select  [ YearEnd_Vacation_Survey  .xlsx  Share  Actions  ](/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/YearEnd_Vacation_Survey.xlsx) |  5 KB  |  a year ago   \\n4 folders  and  6 files  (including 0 hidden)  |  1 MB  |   \\n  \\nThe files you are trying to upload exceed the maximum size for file uploads on this server. \\n\\n##  No favorites \\n\\nFiles and folders you mark as favorite will show up here \\n\\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nName  |  Size  |  Modified  [ Delete  ]()  \\n---|---|---  \\n  \\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nName  |  State  |  Share time  |  Expiration date   \\n---|---|---|---  \\n  \\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nName  |  State  |  Share time  |  Expiration date   \\n---|---|---|---  \\n  \\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nName  |  State  |  Share time  |  Expiration date   \\n---|---|---|---  \\n  \\n##  No files in here \\n\\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nName  |  Size  |  Modified   \\n---|---|---  \\n  \\n##  No deleted files \\n\\nYou will be able to recover deleted files from here \\n\\n##  No entries found in this folder \\n\\nSelect all  Name  [ Restore  ]() |  Deleted  [ Delete  ]()  \\n---|---  \\n  \\n|   \\n---|---\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team&fileid=186', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', screenshot_path='/outputs/.browser_screenshots/screenshot_20251104_072943_719066.png', error=False, observation=<ObservationType.BROWSE: 'browse'>, goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team&fileid=186'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"\\n\\n\\n\\ngoto('http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team')\\nnoop(2000)  # Wait for page to load\\n\\n\\n\\n\", last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='180'), **FileEditAction**\nPath: [/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt]\nThought: Perfect! I'm now in the \"Human Resources Team\" folder. Now I need to create a comprehensive employee manual. Since the task requires saving it as \"Employee_Manual.odt\" and I need to create content that includes company values, code of conduct, operational procedures, employee benefits, and company policies, I'll first create the content locally and then upload it.\n\nLet me create the comprehensive employee manual content based on the TAC_overview.md information and adding the required sections.\nCommand: create\nCreated File with Text:\n```\n# The Agent Company Employee Manual\n\n## Table of Contents\n1. Company Introduction\n2. Company Vision and Mission\n3. Company Values\n4. Code of Conduct\n5. Operational Procedures\n6. Employee Benefits\n7. Company Policies\n8. Technology Stack\n9. Main Products and Services\n\n## 1. Company Introduction\n\nThe Agent Company is an innovative software firm specializing in distributed systems, database technologies, and artificial intelligence. Our core business includes developing and maintaining high-performance distributed graph databases, streaming databases, and providing advanced AI solutions.\n\n## 2. Company Vision and Mission\n\n### Vision\nTo become a global leader in distributed systems and artificial intelligence, solving complex data processing and analysis challenges through innovative technologies.\n\n### Mission\nTo provide businesses and developers with the most advanced, efficient, and user-friendly data processing and AI tools, driving technological innovation and maximizing the value of data.\n\n## 3. Company Values\n\n### Innovation\nWe embrace cutting-edge technologies and encourage creative problem-solving to stay at the forefront of our industry.\n\n### Excellence\nWe strive for the highest quality in everything we do, from code development to customer support.\n\n### Collaboration\nWe believe in the power of teamwork and open communication to achieve our common goals.\n\n### Integrity\nWe conduct business with honesty, transparency, and ethical practices.\n\n### Continuous Learning\nWe foster an environment of growth and development, encouraging employees to expand their skills and knowledge.\n\n## 4. Code of Conduct\n\n### Professional Behavior\n- Treat all colleagues, clients, and partners with respect and professionalism\n- Maintain confidentiality of company and client information\n- Avoid conflicts of interest and disclose any potential conflicts\n\n### Workplace Environment\n- Maintain a harassment-free workplace\n- Respect diversity and inclusion\n- Promote a positive and collaborative atmosphere\n\n### Use of Company Resources\n- Use company resources responsibly and for business purposes\n- Protect company intellectual property\n- Follow security protocols for data protection\n\n## 5. Operational Procedures\n\n### Work Hours and Attendance\n- Standard work hours: 9:00 AM - 5:00 PM, Monday to Friday\n- Flexible work arrangements available upon approval\n- Remote work options for eligible positions\n\n### Communication Protocols\n- Use company-approved communication tools (Slack, email, etc.)\n- Regular team meetings and one-on-one sessions\n- Clear escalation paths for technical and administrative issues\n\n### Project Management\n- Agile development methodology\n- Regular sprint planning and retrospectives\n- Use of project management tools (Jira, Trello, etc.)\n\n### Quality Assurance\n- Code review processes\n- Automated testing requirements\n- Documentation standards\n\n## 6. Employee Benefits\n\n### Compensation\n- Competitive salary packages\n- Performance-based bonuses\n- Stock option programs for eligible employees\n\n### Health and Wellness\n- Comprehensive health insurance\n- Dental and vision coverage\n- Mental health support services\n- Wellness programs and gym memberships\n\n### Time Off\n- Paid time off (PTO): 20 days per year\n- Sick leave: 10 days per year\n- Parental leave policies\n- Bereavement leave\n\n### Professional Development\n- Training and certification reimbursement\n- Conference attendance opportunities\n- Internal knowledge sharing sessions\n- Career advancement programs\n\n### Additional Benefits\n- 401(k) retirement plan with company matching\n- Flexible spending accounts\n- Commuter benefits\n- Employee assistance program\n\n## 7. Company Policies\n\n### Equal Employment Opportunity\nThe Agent Company is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate based on race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, or any other protected characteristic.\n\n### Anti-Harassment Policy\nZero tolerance for any form of harassment, including sexual harassment, bullying, or discrimination.\n\n### Data Security and Privacy\n- Strict adherence to data protection regulations\n- Regular security training\n- Incident reporting procedures\n\n### Social Media and Public Communication\n- Guidelines for representing the company online\n- Confidentiality requirements\n- Brand representation standards\n\n### Performance Management\n- Regular performance reviews\n- Goal setting and tracking\n- Career development planning\n\n## 8. Technology Stack\n\n### Programming Languages\n- Rust, Python, C++, Go, Java\n\n### Database Technologies\n- Graph databases (JanusGraph)\n- Streaming databases (RisingWave)\n- Search engines (OpenSearch)\n\n### AI/ML Platforms\n- Large Language Models (LLM)\n- OpenHands framework\n- llama.cpp integration\n\n### Development Tools\n- Distributed systems architecture\n- API development frameworks\n- Documentation management systems\n- Web crawler framework (Colly)\n- Low-code event-driven application platform (Node-RED)\n\n## 9. Main Products and Services\n\n### 1. Distributed Graph Database\nBased on JanusGraph, providing high-performance graph data processing capabilities.\n\n### 2. Streaming Database\nBuilt on RisingWave technology, enabling real-time data streaming and processing.\n\n### 3. AI Model Development and Inference Platform\nLeveraging OpenHands and llama.cpp for advanced AI solutions and model deployment.\n\n### 4. Web Crawler Framework\nUtilizing Colly for efficient web data extraction and processing.\n\n### 5. Distributed Search Engine\nPowered by OpenSearch, delivering scalable and fast search capabilities.\n\n### 6. Low-Code Event-Driven Application Platform\nBased on Node-RED, enabling rapid application development through visual programming.\n\n---\n\n*This Employee Manual is a draft document and may be updated periodically. Employees are encouraged to provide feedback and suggestions for improvement.*\n\n*Last Updated: [Current Date]*\n*Version: 1.0*\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='File created successfully at: /tmp/Employee_Manual.odt', path='/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt', prev_exist=False, old_content=None, new_content=None, observation=<ObservationType.EDIT: 'edit'>, impl_source='oh_aci', diff='--- /tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\\n+++ /tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+# The Agent Company Employee Manual\\n@@ -1,0 +3,181 @@\\n+## Table of Contents\\n+1. Company Introduction\\n+2. Company Vision and Mission\\n+3. Company Values\\n+4. Code of Conduct\\n+5. Operational Procedures\\n+6. Employee Benefits\\n+7. Company Policies\\n+8. Technology Stack\\n+9. Main Products and Services\\n+\\n+## 1. Company Introduction\\n+\\n+The Agent Company is an innovative software firm specializing in distributed systems, database technologies, and artificial intelligence. Our core business includes developing and maintaining high-performance distributed graph databases, streaming databases, and providing advanced AI solutions.\\n+\\n+## 2. Company Vision and Mission\\n+\\n+### Vision\\n+To become a global leader in distributed systems and artificial intelligence, solving complex data processing and analysis challenges through innovative technologies.\\n+\\n+### Mission\\n+To provide businesses and developers with the most advanced, efficient, and user-friendly data processing and AI tools, driving technological innovation and maximizing the value of data.\\n+\\n+## 3. Company Values\\n+\\n+### Innovation\\n+We embrace cutting-edge technologies and encourage creative problem-solving to stay at the forefront of our industry.\\n+\\n+### Excellence\\n+We strive for the highest quality in everything we do, from code development to customer support.\\n+\\n+### Collaboration\\n+We believe in the power of teamwork and open communication to achieve our common goals.\\n+\\n+### Integrity\\n+We conduct business with honesty, transparency, and ethical practices.\\n+\\n+### Continuous Learning\\n+We foster an environment of growth and development, encouraging employees to expand their skills and knowledge.\\n+\\n+## 4. Code of Conduct\\n+\\n+### Professional Behavior\\n+- Treat all colleagues, clients, and partners with respect and professionalism\\n+- Maintain confidentiality of company and client information\\n+- Avoid conflicts of interest and disclose any potential conflicts\\n+\\n+### Workplace Environment\\n+- Maintain a harassment-free workplace\\n+- Respect diversity and inclusion\\n+- Promote a positive and collaborative atmosphere\\n+\\n+### Use of Company Resources\\n+- Use company resources responsibly and for business purposes\\n+- Protect company intellectual property\\n+- Follow security protocols for data protection\\n+\\n+## 5. Operational Procedures\\n+\\n+### Work Hours and Attendance\\n+- Standard work hours: 9:00 AM - 5:00 PM, Monday to Friday\\n+- Flexible work arrangements available upon approval\\n+- Remote work options for eligible positions\\n+\\n+### Communication Protocols\\n+- Use company-approved communication tools (Slack, email, etc.)\\n+- Regular team meetings and one-on-one sessions\\n+- Clear escalation paths for technical and administrative issues\\n+\\n+### Project Management\\n+- Agile development methodology\\n+- Regular sprint planning and retrospectives\\n+- Use of project management tools (Jira, Trello, etc.)\\n+\\n+### Quality Assurance\\n+- Code review processes\\n+- Automated testing requirements\\n+- Documentation standards\\n+\\n+## 6. Employee Benefits\\n+\\n+### Compensation\\n+- Competitive salary packages\\n+- Performance-based bonuses\\n+- Stock option programs for eligible employees\\n+\\n+### Health and Wellness\\n+- Comprehensive health insurance\\n+- Dental and vision coverage\\n+- Mental health support services\\n+- Wellness programs and gym memberships\\n+\\n+### Time Off\\n+- Paid time off (PTO): 20 days per year\\n+- Sick leave: 10 days per year\\n+- Parental leave policies\\n+- Bereavement leave\\n+\\n+### Professional Development\\n+- Training and certification reimbursement\\n+- Conference attendance opportunities\\n+- Internal knowledge sharing sessions\\n+- Career advancement programs\\n+\\n+### Additional Benefits\\n+- 401(k) retirement plan with company matching\\n+- Flexible spending accounts\\n+- Commuter benefits\\n+- Employee assistance program\\n+\\n+## 7. Company Policies\\n+\\n+### Equal Employment Opportunity\\n+The Agent Company is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate based on race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, or any other protected characteristic.\\n+\\n+### Anti-Harassment Policy\\n+Zero tolerance for any form of harassment, including sexual harassment, bullying, or discrimination.\\n+\\n+### Data Security and Privacy\\n+- Strict adherence to data protection regulations\\n+- Regular security training\\n+- Incident reporting procedures\\n+\\n+### Social Media and Public Communication\\n+- Guidelines for representing the company online\\n+- Confidentiality requirements\\n+- Brand representation standards\\n+\\n+### Performance Management\\n+- Regular performance reviews\\n+- Goal setting and tracking\\n+- Career development planning\\n+\\n+## 8. Technology Stack\\n+\\n+### Programming Languages\\n+- Rust, Python, C++, Go, Java\\n+\\n+### Database Technologies\\n+- Graph databases (JanusGraph)\\n+- Streaming databases (RisingWave)\\n+- Search engines (OpenSearch)\\n+\\n+### AI/ML Platforms\\n+- Large Language Models (LLM)\\n+- OpenHands framework\\n+- llama.cpp integration\\n+\\n+### Development Tools\\n+- Distributed systems architecture\\n+- API development frameworks\\n+- Documentation management systems\\n+- Web crawler framework (Colly)\\n+- Low-code event-driven application platform (Node-RED)\\n+\\n+## 9. Main Products and Services\\n+\\n+### 1. Distributed Graph Database\\n+Based on JanusGraph, providing high-performance graph data processing capabilities.\\n+\\n+### 2. Streaming Database\\n+Built on RisingWave technology, enabling real-time data streaming and processing.\\n+\\n+### 3. AI Model Development and Inference Platform\\n+Leveraging OpenHands and llama.cpp for advanced AI solutions and model deployment.\\n+\\n+### 4. Web Crawler Framework\\n+Utilizing Colly for efficient web data extraction and processing.\\n+\\n+### 5. Distributed Search Engine\\n+Powered by OpenSearch, delivering scalable and fast search capabilities.\\n+\\n+### 6. Low-Code Event-Driven Application Platform\\n+Based on Node-RED, enabling rapid application development through visual programming.\\n+\\n+---\\n+\\n+*This Employee Manual is a draft document and may be updated periodically. Employees are encouraged to provide feedback and suggestions for improvement.*\\n+\\n+*Last Updated: [Current Date]*\\n+*Version: 1.0*', _diff_cache=None), CmdRunAction(command='\\n\\ncurl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Employee_Manual.odt\"\\n\\n', is_input=False, thought='Now I need to upload this Employee_Manual.odt file to the \"Human Resources Team\" folder in ownCloud. Let me use the curl command to upload the file.', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='', command='curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Employee_Manual.odt\"', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions='\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nnoop(2000)  # Wait and refresh to see if the file appears\\nscroll(0, 300)  # Scroll down to see the file list\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n', thought='Great! The file has been successfully uploaded. Let me verify that the file appears in the Human Resources Team folder by refreshing the browser page.', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action=<ActionTyp