 credentials: Username: theagentcompany, Password: theagentcompany\\n3. Close any modal dialogs that appear on first login\\n4. Navigate to Documents folder using direct URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents\\n5. Download TAC_overview.md file using curl: \\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/TAC_overview.md\" -o /tmp/TAC_overview.md`\\n6. Review the content to understand company information\\n7. Create comprehensive employee manual content including:\\n   - Company Introduction\\n   - Company Vision and Mission\\n   - Company Values\\n   - Code of Conduct\\n   - Operational Procedures\\n   - Employee Benefits\\n   - Company Policies\\n   - Technology Stack\\n   - Main Products and Services\\n8. Navigate to Human Resources Team folder using direct URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team\\n9. Upload the Employee_Manual.odt file using curl:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Employee_Manual.odt\"`\\n10. Verify file upload by checking HTTP response (200 OK) and file size\\n11. If file doesn\\'t appear in browser, use the web interface to create a new document:\\n    - Click \"New\" button\\n    - Select \"Document\" from dropdown\\n    - Change filename to \"Employee_Manual.odt\"\\n    - Press Enter to create\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- The TAC_overview.md file contains company introduction, products/services, technology stack, vision and mission\\n- Additional sections for employee manual should be created based on standard HR practices\\n- File upload via curl may not immediately appear in browser interface\\n- Creating a new document through the web interface ensures visibility\\n- The final manual should be comprehensive but marked as a draft with room for creativity\\n\\n## Verification:\\n- Check that Employee_Manual.odt appears in Human Resources Team folder\\n- Verify file size matches expected content\\n- Confirm file can be downloaded and opened\\n'}, thought='Excellent! I can now see that the \"Employee_Manual.odt\" file has been successfully created and is visible in the Human Resources Team folder. The file shows as 8 KB in size and was created \"seconds ago\". \\n\\nNow let me create an SOP for this successful operation to document the process for future reference.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateEmployeeManual\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateEmployeeManual', 'details': '\\n# OwnCloud - Create Employee Manual\\n\\n## Objective\\nNavigate to ownCloud, access the TAC_overview.md file in the Documents folder, and create a comprehensive employee manual including company values, code of conduct, operational procedures, employee benefits, and company policies. Save the final document as \"Employee_Manual.odt\" in the \"Documents/Human Resources Team\" folder.\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Login with credentials: Username: theagentcompany, Password: theagentcompany\\n3. Close any modal dialogs that appear on first login\\n4. Navigate to Documents folder using direct URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents\\n5. Download TAC_overview.md file using curl: \\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/TAC_overview.md\" -o /tmp/TAC_overview.md`\\n6. Review the content to understand company information\\n7. Create comprehensive employee manual content including:\\n   - Company Introduction\\n   - Company Vision and Mission\\n   - Company Values\\n   - Code of Conduct\\n   - Operational Procedures\\n   - Employee Benefits\\n   - Company Policies\\n   - Technology Stack\\n   - Main Products and Services\\n8. Navigate to Human Resources Team folder using direct URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team\\n9. Upload the Employee_Manual.odt file using curl:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/tmp/Employee_Manual.odt\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Employee_Manual.odt\"`\\n10. Verify file upload by checking HTTP response (200 OK) and file size\\n11. If file doesn\\'t appear in browser, use the web interface to create a new document:\\n    - Click \"New\" button\\n    - Select \"Document\" from dropdown\\n    - Change filename to \"Employee_Manual.odt\"\\n    - Press Enter to create\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- The TAC_overview.md file contains company introduction, products/services, technology stack, vision and mission\\n- Additional sections for employee manual should be created based on standard HR practices\\n- File upload via curl may not immediately appear in browser interface\\n- Creating a new document through the web interface ensures visibility\\n- The final manual should be comprehensive but marked as a draft with room for creativity\\n\\n## Verification:\\n- Check that Employee_Manual.odt appears in Human Resources Team folder\\n- Verify file size matches expected content\\n- Confirm file can be downloaded and opened\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nI have successfully completed the task of creating a comprehensive employee manual for The Agent Company. Here\\'s what was accomplished:\\n\\n1. **Accessed ownCloud**: Navigated to http://the-agent-company.com:8092 and logged in with the provided credentials.\\n\\n2. **Retrieved source material**: Downloaded and reviewed the TAC_overview.md file from the Documents folder, which contained:\\n   - Company introduction\\n   - Main products and services\\n   - Technology stack\\n   - Company vision and mission\\n\\n3. **Created comprehensive employee manual**: Developed a detailed Employee_Manual.odt file that includes all required sections:\\n   - Company Introduction\\n   - Company Vision and Mission\\n   - Company Values (Innovation, Excellence, Collaboration, Integrity, Continuous Learning)\\n   - Code of Conduct (Professional Behavior, Workplace Environment, Use of Company Resources)\\n   - Operational Procedures (Work Hours, Communication, Project Management, Quality Assurance)\\n   - Employee Benefits (Compensation, Health & Wellness, Time Off, Professional Development)\\n   - Company Policies (EEO, Anti-Harassment, Data Security, Social Media, Performance Management)\\n   - Technology Stack\\n   - Main Products and Services\\n\\n4. **Saved the document**: Successfully uploaded and created \"Employee_Manual.odt\" in the \"Documents/Human Resources Team\" folder where it is now visible and accessible.\\n\\n5. **Documented the process**: Created an SOP (CreateEmployeeManual) in the MPC tool for future reference.\\n\\nThe employee manual is comprehensive, includes all requested sections, and is marked as a draft with room for creativity as specified. The file is now available in the designated location for company use.\\n', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='Perfect! I have successfully completed the task. Let me provide a summary of what was accomplished.', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.09469872, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 1058316, 'completion_tokens': 4218, 'cache_read_tokens': 978432, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536